@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<div class="page-header">
    <h1>About</h1>
</div>

<div class="panel prose">
    <p>
        AuctionApp is a simplified auction system built for lab 2 in HI1031 Distributed Information Systems
        at KTH Royal Institute of Technology.
    </p>
    <p>
        It is written in ASP.NET Core MVC with a three-tier architecture: controllers and views on top,
        a service layer with the auction rules in the middle, and Entity Framework Core persistence at the bottom.
        Each layer talks to the one below it through an interface.
    </p>
    <p>
        Users can create auctions, edit their own descriptions, place bids on other people's items,
        and follow the auctions they have bid on or won.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-4">Developed by</h2>
    <p>Ibrahim Awad and Wajeed Abid</p>
</div>
